Modifications
-------------
Modified in 2026-11: the build toolchain and dependencies were upgraded, the
Wear OS UI was rewritten with Wear Compose and Navigation 3, the phone app was
restyled with Material 3 Expressive, and the license list was moved to
AboutLibraries. Corresponding source is this repository.

